From: David Lang <david@lang.hm>
Subject: [PATCH] prometheus-node-exporter-lua: drop quality and signal metrics

SCALE local carry of a packages-feed change that removes
wifi_network_quality and wifi_network_signal_dbm from the wifi.lua
collector, and bumps PKG_RELEASE from 1 to 2.

Those metrics are not radio measurements. libiwinfo
nl80211_fill_signal() integer-averages NL80211_STA_INFO_SIGNAL across
associated stations; nl80211_get_quality() clamps that average to
[-110, -40] dBm and adds 110 (quality_max is a constant 70); wifi.lua
then scaled quality to 0-100. The result is meaningless: 0 or -255
with no clients, a strong client hides a weak one, and quality
saturates at -40 dBm. Per-station signal (the wifi_stations collector
or the syslog collector) is the useful figure. bitrate and noise stay.

Applied to the packages feed (sarcasticadmin/opkgs @ OPENWRT_PKG_VERSION,
currently 2db11f3) after `feeds update` and before `feeds install`.

The deciding drop signal is the on-device behavioral test
(wifi_lua_metrics_test.sh) passing on an image built without this
patch (SOURCE_PATCH_MODE=trial SKIP_SOURCE_PATCHES=packages/001), not
the presence of any upstream commit.

Retiring the existing overlay (860258f), the golden copy, and the
.gitignore negation is a follow-up and is not part of this change.
The server-side Alloy drop (31df527, c33984f) should stay as a
backstop for old images.

---

diff --git a/utils/prometheus-node-exporter-lua/Makefile b/utils/prometheus-node-exporter-lua/Makefile
index 37c6f7d..0f77389 100644
--- a/utils/prometheus-node-exporter-lua/Makefile
+++ b/utils/prometheus-node-exporter-lua/Makefile
@@ -5,7 +5,7 @@ include $(TOPDIR)/rules.mk
 
 PKG_NAME:=prometheus-node-exporter-lua
 PKG_VERSION:=2025.11.22
-PKG_RELEASE:=1
+PKG_RELEASE:=2
 
 PKG_MAINTAINER:=Etienne CHAMPETIER <champetier.etienne@gmail.com>
 PKG_LICENSE:=Apache-2.0
diff --git a/utils/prometheus-node-exporter-lua/files/usr/lib/lua/prometheus-collectors/wifi.lua b/utils/prometheus-node-exporter-lua/files/usr/lib/lua/prometheus-collectors/wifi.lua
index 4b1e8f4..6a00e8d 100644
--- a/utils/prometheus-node-exporter-lua/files/usr/lib/lua/prometheus-collectors/wifi.lua
+++ b/utils/prometheus-node-exporter-lua/files/usr/lib/lua/prometheus-collectors/wifi.lua
@@ -2,10 +2,8 @@ local ubus = require "ubus"
 local iwinfo = require "iwinfo"
 
 local function scrape()
-  local metric_wifi_network_quality = metric("wifi_network_quality","gauge")
   local metric_wifi_network_bitrate = metric("wifi_network_bitrate","gauge")
   local metric_wifi_network_noise = metric("wifi_network_noise_dbm","gauge")
-  local metric_wifi_network_signal = metric("wifi_network_signal_dbm","gauge")
 
   local u = ubus.connect()
   local status = u:call("network.wireless", "status", {})
@@ -26,17 +24,8 @@ local function scrape()
           device = dev,
         }
 
-        local qc = iw.quality(ifname) or 0
-        local qm = iw.quality_max(ifname) or 0
-        local quality = 0
-        if qc > 0 and qm > 0 then
-          quality = math.floor((100 / qm) * qc)
-        end
-
-        metric_wifi_network_quality(labels, quality)
         metric_wifi_network_noise(labels, iw.noise(ifname) or 0)
         metric_wifi_network_bitrate(labels, iw.bitrate(ifname) or 0)
-        metric_wifi_network_signal(labels, iw.signal(ifname) or -255)
       end
     end
   end
